# --- Secretos (defensa en profundidad, ver opencode.json / AGENTS.md) ---
# Nunca commitear claves, keystores ni credenciales Firebase.
.env*
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/key.properties
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/local.properties

# --- Flutter multi-app (appCabina360V2.3/, flutter_gen_licens/, futuras apps) ---
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.pub/
**/.pub-cache/
**/coverage/
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
app.*.symbols
app.*.map.json

# --- Android (refuerza android/.gitignore de cada app) ---
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/captures/
**/android/.cxx/
**/android/app/debug
**/android/app/profile
**/android/app/release

# --- iOS / macOS ---
**/Pods/
**/DerivedData/
**/Flutter/Flutter.framework/
**/Flutter/App.framework/
**/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh

# --- IDE / OS ---
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

